background
==========


dependencies
============
X11, raylib, g++


usage
=====
    Usage: background [--help] [--version] [--vertices VAR] [--edges VAR]

    Optional arguments:
      -h, --help     shows help message and exits
      -v, --version  prints version information and exits
      --vertices     number of vertices in the graph [nargs=0..1] [default: 200]
      -e, --edges    number of edges in the graph [nargs=0..1] [default: 1000]

examples
========
    background --edges 50 --vertices 10
    background --edges 1500 --vertices 1000
